><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20251008130724+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="456ea7ce-d241-43b0-9bd7-69bc27dc1274" date="D:20251008130724+10'00'" name="91ddf8c9-1982-45e8-9794-70aa2c7e2ad2" icon="Comment" page="9" rect="49.300491,277.235992,73.300491,301.235992" subject="Sticky Note" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>There is the potential to successfully&#xD;address these challenges using the implementation driver’s&#xD;framework.</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-8.7pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>35,38 </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Implementation drivers to consider,&#xD;include education for athletes, coaches, and&#xD;organisation leaders to highlight the value of the&#xD;KNEE program for all involved and provide guidance&#xD;for program delivery with high fidelity and engagement.&#xD;Changing position descriptions and performance&#xD;assessment policy for coaches and support staff and&#xD;changing the KNEE program structure are also strategies&#xD;worth trialling.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="9" rect="595.276001,209.235992,779.276001,301.235992"
/></text
><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20251008130731+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="456ea7ce-d241-43b0-9bd7-69bc27dc1274" date="D:20251008130731+10'00'" name="51ab4a2a-e819-47cf-a714-5a9452dd644b" icon="Comment" page="9" rect="49.300491,277.235992,73.300491,301.235992" subject="Sticky Note" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14a: yes the aim of the study was answered</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="9" rect="595.276001,209.235992,779.276001,301.235992"
/></text
